<div><b>VO2 drift</b></div><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/patrickwoolf/my-online-drive/main/assets/Note_CPET/1778905910414.jpg" class=""><div></div><div><br></div><div><ul><li><p><strong>Ramp test 會低估真實 steady-state VO₂，因為 VO₂ kinetics 有時間延遲（基礎知識）</strong><br>在 ramp incremental exercise 中，功率（PO）持續上升，但 VO₂ 無法即時跟上，因此量到的 VO₂ 其實反映的是「稍早之前」的功率需求。尤其進入 heavy/severe domain 後，VO₂ slow component（VO₂sc）需要數分鐘才逐漸出現，但 ramp 沒有給它足夠時間「長出來」，因此 ramp 的 VO₂/PO slope（s2-ramp）會低於真正 steady-state CWR 的 slope（s2-CWR），造成 RCP/AT2 workload 被高估。</p></li><li><p><strong>Lactate non-steady、VO₂ non-steady、fatigue inevitability 不是同一件事（重要新觀念）</strong><br>傳統常把「超過 MLSS」直接等同於「VO₂ 不可能穩態、很快 exhaustion」，但實際上三者發生時間不同：</p><ul><li>血乳酸失穩（La⁻↑）可能最早出現；</li><li>VO₂ 持續上升（VO₂ drift）可能晚很多才明顯；</li></ul><ul><li>exhaustion 更晚才發生。<br>因此：<br>PO &gt; MLSS<br>不等於：<br>- VO2 立刻無法暫時穩態<br>超過 MLSS 代表代謝穩定性開始惡化，但不是瞬間跨入「完全失穩」。</li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Severe domain 的 VO₂ slow component 更像 slow drift，而不是 rapid runaway（最新理論修正）</strong><br>傳統模型認為 severe domain 中 VO₂ 會快速失控並一路衝向 VO₂max，但很多情況下 VO₂ 並不是快速暴衝，而是非常緩慢地上升（slow drift）。因此在 MLSS + 10W 等 lower severe 強度下，受試者可能在 15–30 分鐘內仍呈現「近似穩態」。這表示 severe domain 可能不是單一「完全非穩態區」，而是存在一段可暫時維持代謝穩定的 transitional zone。</p></li></ul><div><br></div></div><div>//</div><div><div>李醫師2026 ACSM那篇，是用MLSS當constant workload，發現VO2還處於steady state。</div><div><br></div><div>我的理解 : 表示其實MLSS 可能 &lt; RCP。</div><div>真正的RCP應該要是找到VO2 unsteady的那個workload。</div><div><br></div><div>是這樣嗎？</div></div><div><br></div><div>===========================================</div><div><b>Lactate @MLSS vs. MLSS+10的功率</b></div><div><h2 style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 28px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-size: 1.0625rem; font-weight: 700; scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none; color: rgb(250, 250, 249); font-family: Lora, &quot;Lora Fallback&quot;; background-color: rgb(31, 30, 30);"><span style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;">第一個重點：VT1以下運動的乳酸動力學基本知識</span></h2><ul style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; padding: 0px 0px 0px 28px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); list-style: disc; scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none; color: rgb(250, 250, 249); font-family: Lora, &quot;Lora Fallback&quot;; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(31, 30, 30);"><li style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;"><p style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 2px 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700; scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;">乳酸濃度維持接近靜息值</span>：在第一通氣閾值（VT1）以下進行恆定負荷有氧運動時，血乳酸濃度僅輕微上升，並在1-4分鐘內達到穩定狀態</p></li><li style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;"><p style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 2px 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700; scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;">乳酸產生與清除平衡</span>：此強度下乳酸的產生速率與清除速率相匹配，代謝清除率（MCR）在乳酸閾值以下達到峰值</p></li><li style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;"><p style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 2px 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700; scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;">快速達到代謝穩態</span>：氧攝取動力學呈單指數型快速達到穩態，血乳酸維持在低且穩定的濃度</p></li><li style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;"><p style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 2px 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700; scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;">VT1的生理意義</span>：VT1對應於乳酸清除能力的限制點，即乳酸清除無法再跟上產生速率的臨界點</p></li></ul><h2 style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 28px 0px 12px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-size: 1.0625rem; font-weight: 700; scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none; color: rgb(250, 250, 249); font-family: Lora, &quot;Lora Fallback&quot;; background-color: rgb(31, 30, 30);"><span style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;">第二個重點：從VT1負荷轉換至VT2負荷的乳酸反應</span></h2><ul style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; padding: 0px 0px 0px 28px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); list-style: disc; scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none; color: rgb(250, 250, 249); font-family: Lora, &quot;Lora Fallback&quot;; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(31, 30, 30);"><li style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;"><p style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 2px 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700; scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;">無法達到相同的穩態</span>：從VT1強度（如90W）運動10分鐘後轉換至VT2強度（如130W），乳酸不會像VT1時那樣達到穩定狀態</p></li><li style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;"><p style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 2px 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700; scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;">關鍵取決於是否超過最大乳酸穩態（MLSS）</span>：</p><ul style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; padding: 0px 0px 0px 28px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); list-style: disc; scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;"><li style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;"><p style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 2px 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700; scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;">若在MLSS以下（VT1與VT2之間）</span>：乳酸會升高但最終仍可達到較高的穩態，只是需要更長時間</p></li><li style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;"><p style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 2px 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700; scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;">若達到或超過MLSS（接近或超過VT2）</span>：即使僅增加10W的負荷，乳酸也會持續累積無法穩定</p></li></ul></li><li style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;"><p style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 2px 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700; scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;">乳酸持續累積的證據</span>：在MLSS以上10W運動時，血乳酸在10-30分鐘間持續上升約1.7 mmol/L，而在MLSS時僅上升約0.5 mmol/L</p></li><li style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;"><p style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 2px 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700; scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;">伴隨的生理壓力</span>：乳酸累積同時伴隨通氣量、呼吸頻率、心率和自覺疲勞度的進行性增加</p></li><li style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;"><p style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 2px 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit; border-color: rgb(61, 56, 48); border-image: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-color: oklab(0.680736 0.132356 0.117324 / 0.5); scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(61, 56, 48) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700; scroll-behavior: smooth; overflow-anchor: none;">臨床意義</span>：VT2代表可持續中等強度運動與無法長時間維持的高強度運動之間的分界點，超過此閾值後運動的可持續性明顯下降</p></li></ul></div>